OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,6,Frain developing, mostly in the west.
OL,7,FCloud breaking to leave a partly
OL,8,Fcloudy afternoon with sunny spells for
OL,9,Fmost. Mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with skies
OL,12,Fclearing overnight, winds become light
OL,13,Fand variable. Fog patches are likely
OL,14,Fto develop by the morning. Feeling
OL,15,Fcooler.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FEarly morning fog patches
OL,18,Fwill lift and clear becoming partly
OL,19,Fcloudy during the morning. Some longer
OL,20,Fsunny intervals develop during the
OL,21,Fafternoon, especially in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
